# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cassava project .gitignore
# Rule of thumb: commit code, configs, small results and charts; never commit
# the dataset, anything that contains its images, environments or big binaries.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Dataset and anything derived from its pixels (licence, rule R12) ----
# Kaggle images and train.csv (13 GB) - download it, never redistribute
dataset/
# DINOv2 embeddings + hashes; recreated by src/01-02 (47 MB)
features/
# cache of the test images themselves (1.7 GB)
reports/robustness_eval/test_uint8_384.npy

# Figures that show dataset photos. Un-ignore (delete the line) only after the
# team has checked the competition licence allows showing images publicly.
reports/figures/samples_per_class.png
reports/figures/group_examples.png
reports/figures/error_analysis/failures_*.png
reports/figures/error_analysis/fixed_by_weights.png
reports/figures/error_analysis/gradcam_failures.png
reports/figures/robustness/corruption_examples.png
reports/robustness_eval/examples.png
# NOTE: notebooks/step3c_error_analysis.ipynb and step3_robustness.ipynb embed
# photos in their outputs. Clear outputs before committing them:
#   venv/bin/jupyter nbconvert --clear-output --inplace notebooks/step3c_error_analysis.ipynb notebooks/step3_robustness.ipynb

# ---- Model checkpoints (about 120 MB each, 50 runs = 6 GB; GitHub limit is 100 MB per file) ----
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
# Run folders are otherwise kept: config.json, history.csv, test_metrics.json,
# test_report.txt, test_probs.npy (small, needed by the analysis notebooks).
# queue lock folders (run_lc.sh)
Deep_Learning/runs/.locks/

# ---- Logs (one per run, full of progress-bar output, 48 MB) ----
logs/
*.log

# ---- Python environments and caches ----
venv/
.venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/

# ---- Experiment trackers, if ever added ----
wandb/
mlruns/

# ---- Secrets (never commit) ----
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
kaggle.json

# ---- Editor / OS files ----
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
